{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"labotep","id":"346493235948158977","is_bot":0,"username":"nyarlathotepcc"},"author_id":"346493235948158977","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"It seemed like a good time to take a break from his work at the temple so Traxim headed down to the river. He’d been wanting to try out one of his purchases from yesterday and this seemed like a good chance. By chance, he arrived a hundred yards or so from the submersible that he would be boarding in less than a week. That would receive his attention later but for now he was lifting up rocks and collecting the worms beneath them. After getting a decent amount he sat down and took a short rod from his pack along with other gear. Upon saying the command word it expanded into a decked out fishing pole. Traxim added some weights and a bobber, baited the hook and cast his line.","created_at":"2020-07-19T19:31:15.139000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734492571002208307","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
